cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Computational Governance for Autonomous Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: Raj
    given-names: Sahin
date-released: 2026-08-09
version: 0.3.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  A formal model, reference implementation, and runtime-agnostic benchmark
  for runtime governance of autonomous systems: deciding whether an agent's
  intended action is permitted before execution, accounting for delegated
  authority, human escalation, revocation, and runtime context change.
